#, fuzzy
msgid "SPIFFE Client"
msgstr "Cliente de SPIFFE"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://spiffe.io/[SPIFFE] (Secure Production Identity Framework for Everyone) provides cryptographic workload identities in zero-trust environments.\n"
"The SPIFFE client extension uses the https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_API.md[Workload API] to retrieve https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/JWT-SVID.md[JWT-SVIDs] and https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/X509-SVID.md[X.509-SVIDs] for Quarkus workloads directly from the local https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/[SPIRE Agent].\n"
"It simplifies deployment by eliminating the need for a SPIFFE client sidecar that stores SVIDs on a mounted file path for Quarkus to read."
msgstr "link:https://spiffe.io/[SPIFFE] (Secure Production Identity Framework for Everyone) proporciona identidades criptográficas para cargas de trabajo en entornos de confianza cero. La extensión de cliente SPIFFE utiliza la link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_API.md[API de cargas de trabajo] para recuperar link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/JWT-SVID.md[JWT-SVID] y link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/X509-SVID.md[X.509-SVID] para las cargas de trabajo de Quarkus directamente desde el link:https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/[agente SPIRE] local. Simplifica la implementación al eliminar la necesidad de un sidecar de cliente SPIFFE que almacene los SVID en una ruta de archivo montada para que Quarkus pueda leerlos."

#, fuzzy
msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "Esta tecnología se considera {extensión-estado}."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In _experimental_ mode, early feedback is requested to mature the idea.\n"
"There is no guarantee of stability nor long term presence in the platform until the solution matures.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "En el modo _experimental_ , se solicitan los primeros comentarios para madurar la idea. No hay garantía de estabilidad ni de presencia a largo plazo en la plataforma hasta que la solución madure. Los comentarios son bienvenidos en nuestra link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[lista de correo] o como cuestiones en nuestro link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[rastreador de problemas de GitHub] ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "Para obtener una lista completa de posibles estados, consulte nuestra  link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[entrada de preguntas frecuentes]."

